    <item>
      <title>Parley 1.3.0 (build 7)</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 17:14:29 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[Parley 1.3.0 — a redesign: tighter and cleaner everywhere; resize the sidebar (Cmd+\ hides it) and the room chat; rooms show who is inside right in the sidebar, double-click to join; a voice dock at the bottom of the sidebar; the voice room is a grid of tiles with volume on right-click; five color schemes (Midnight, Ember, Graphite, Linen, Daylight) plus Match system, and accent colors; clearer voice (96 kbit/s) and gentler noise cancellation.]]></description>
      <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>12.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/Tim-Ostrander/parley-releases/releases/download/v1.3.0-build7/Parley-1.3.0-7.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="a5rm1uk1GFcugRIPvdc12atLpD1syK6rjq20NCT7EdU1X1SKBP15LHgl1WLvjQy31RbU5c1ebqnTEeRQqzbIAQ==" length="182351195" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Parley 1.2.0 (build 6)</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 00:40:04 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[Parley 1.2.0 — echo cancellation for Mumble voice (no more hearing yourself back on speakers); Mumble: encrypted UDP voice, whisper and shout, create/rename/move/delete channels, register on a server; send big files on self-hosted servers (up to 2 GB) with real progress, cancel and resume; Windows: global push-to-talk hotkeys, Ctrl/Alt key names, no flash at launch.]]></description>
      <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>12.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/Tim-Ostrander/parley-releases/releases/download/v1.2.0-build6/Parley-1.2.0-6.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="wgMaTTMIppufbK7c8xhP8NyZNCxCvOk9c7RiZ4w2cnIwKKOjLB/0X4qaSEv0f0awFuiNCZ6UfCdaWwXyc63nDg==" length="183666555" />
