    <item>
      <title>Parley 1.1.2 (build 5)</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 21:05:25 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[Parley 1.1.2 — clearer feedback: rooms, channels and buttons highlight on hover and animate when clicked; Settings always returns you to where you were; Output volume now applies to everyone you hear; Mumble uses the microphone and speakers chosen in Settings; switching spaces and servers lands where you meant to go.]]></description>
